          'Count atoms: eight corners at one eighth each, plus one whole centre atom, giving two',
          'Recognise that atoms touch along the body diagonal, not along the cell edge',
          'The body diagonal has length root three times the lattice parameter and spans four atomic radii',
          'Rearrange to relate the lattice parameter to the atomic radius',
