        complexity: { best: 'a single treatment achieves the required property combination', avg: 'quench and temper is the standard route for medium carbon steels', worst: 'a thick section may not achieve uniform properties by any treatment', note: 'This is the materials science chain from Module 1, now with its middle link fully explained.' },
